         rotation,  cos[:, :, 64:] is its exact duplicate.  Here 2*rotary_dim==128 whereas
         head_dim=256, so cos is NARROWER than the head and apply_rotary_pos_emb slices q,k to
         cos.shape[-1]=64 anyway.

